    <string name="about_title">About Piano2MIDI</string>
    <string name="about_text">Converts piano recordings to MIDI using the hFT-Transformer (Hierarchical Frequency-Time Transformer) by Sony, ISMIR 2023 (arXiv:2307.04305).\n\nAll processing happens on this device: audio → 16 kHz log-mel spectrogram → hFT-Transformer → onset/offset/frame/velocity → notes → MIDI.\n\nSource code: MIT License, © Sony Group Corporation.\nModel weights: trained on MAESTRO v3.0.0, CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 (non-commercial use only).\n\nBest results come from solo piano recordings.</string>
